-	Official opening of Air Cargo Control Unit at “Zhetysu” Customs post in Almaty international airport; 
-	Advanced training on Intellectual Property Rights for the Customs officers of Air Cargo Control Unit at “Zhetysu” Customs post in Almaty international airport.
-	Online training on gender and human rights for law enforcement officers (for IMT and BLO project beneficiaries) on 4-5 February 2021.
-	Mentorship programme for ACCU in Almaty airport, 4-8 October 2021, Almaty; 
-       Session dedicated to Gender Mainstreaming and International Framework of Human Rights, Annual Project Steering Committee Meeting in Almaty, 16-17 November 2021
